{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink doorbell connects my recent Echo purchases with my earlier door alarm purchase, making it a plausible next addition if it works with my Echo devices.",
    "The SanDisk memory card fits my history of buying removable storage and a card reader, provided my devices support its capacity."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Ring charging station needs equipment I have not shown that I own, and my Mac accessories do not establish that I can set up an AirTag.",
    "Another Fire TV stick would duplicate my recent 4K Max purchase, while earbuds and a dedicated calling headset do not address a current need shown by my purchases."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Bluetooth computer accessories seems to have been stretched into an interest in wireless earbuds, even though those serve a different purpose.",
    "My Alexa purchases make compatible home devices relevant, but they do not mean I want several cameras or another streaming stick right now."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent purchases matter as things I already have: the Echo Show stand complements my display, whereas another streaming stick repeats a purchase.",
    "I would start with a doorbell and decide whether I need more cameras afterward; interest in home security does not mean I am ready for a whole bundle."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in practical electronics and Alexa devices but sometimes missed compatibility requirements, existing ownership, and whether I have a reason to buy now."
}"}
